*Solution Steps Walkthrough:*

1. Exploit the even symmetry of the integrand to extend the integration to $(-oo, oo)$.
2. Close the contour in the upper half plane.
3. Identify the pole at $z = i$ of order 3 and compute its residue.
4. Apply the Residue Theorem and divide by 2.
